[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よーし。これでツォルンフルクの苦手な匂いは\n準備できたね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perfect! That Zornfluch is going to hate this scent!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次はこの高音発生器が仕上がれば、完璧なはず",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Once this high-frequency generator is finished, we'll be all set."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユミアはすごいよね。ぱぱっと作り方を\n思いついちゃうんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're amazing, Yumia. How do you come up with solutions just like that!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこからすぐに、この世界のレシピを\n組み立てられるアルビーナがすごいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And you're the amazing one, Alvina, adapting those ideas into recipes that work in this world."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "シンプルなのに奥が深い。この世界の錬金術も\nすごい技術……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The alchemy here is incredible... simple, yet so profound."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシも出会った時、びっくりしたし感動したよ！\n……よし。ここで集中して",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was so amazed when I first encountered it too! Now then, let's focus on—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひぇっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しゅ、瞬間移動したの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "D-did they just teleport!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは。危機一髪だったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha, that was a close one!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ！\u3000レスナ、おかえり～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah! Welcome back, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レイニャ！？\u3000ニーナさん！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja!? Nina!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただいま！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ！\u3000お兄ちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah! Viktor!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アイラか！\u3000ルトガーも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla! And Rutger too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、これで全員出会えたってことだね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like everyone's found each other now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。無事でよかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, I'm glad everyone's safe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう、すっごく大変だったんだよ〜？\n主にルトガーのせいで！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh, we went through so much trouble... mostly because of Rutger!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前、また勝手な行動を取ったのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't tell me you went off and did something reckless again."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "勝手っていうか……あんな石が……ありゃ事故だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It wasn't like that... that stone... was a mistake."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちもなかなか大変だったのよねぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We had quite the adventure ourselves."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ニーナさんが……怪しい石を削ったり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina was... grinding up suspicious stones..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "石……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stones...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずは情報を擦り合わせたほうがよさそうだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We should probably compare notes first."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね。こっちも色々分かったことがあるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right. We've learned quite a bit ourselves."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]